{"text":"永平三年九月四日，比丘尼法慶爲七世父母、所生因緣敬造彌勒像一軀。願使來世託生西方妙樂國土，下生人間公主文君，遠離煩惱。又〔願〕己身與彌勒俱生蓮華下，三會説法。一切衆生□□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法慶","refId":null,"text":"法慶","start":12,"end":14},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":26,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"妙樂國土","refId":null,"text":"妙樂國土","start":40,"end":44},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":66,"end":68},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"生蓮華","start":69,"end":72},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":74,"end":76},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":81,"end":83}]}